{"ID":"20240118151331-hhbgubl","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151331-hhbgubl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151331-hhbgubl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122084624-2z78vdp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122084657-gu8aqrs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:289,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122084657-gu8aqrs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"061蒲黄","type":"doc","updated":"20240129112858"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240122084624-2z78vdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084624-2z78vdp","updated":"20240122084638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘平，主心腹膀胱寒热，利小便，止血消瘀血，久服轻身，益气力延年神仙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084642-ykhutx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084642-ykhutx2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】香蒲为生于池沼之宿根草，处处有之，蒲黄乃蒲花之花粉，入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084646-0sph5d9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084646-0sph5d9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘辛，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084648-qgab756","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084648-qgab756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蒲黄为凉血活血散结除热要药，生用消瘀通经，疗扑打损伤，炒黑用止血止崩，止带止遗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084650-am10mtc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084650-am10mtc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治痢血鼻衄，吐血，尿血，泻血，利水道，通经络，止女子崩中。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084651-229b9ia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084651-229b9ia"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】妇人带下，月侯不匀，血气心腹痛，妊妇下血，坠眙，血运，血症，儿枕气痛，颠扑血闷，排脓，疮疖，游风肿毒，下乳汁，止泄精。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084654-j9xvjgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084654-j9xvjgj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通七分至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084656-pkvtcj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084656-pkvtcj0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】一切劳伤发热，阴虚内热，无瘀血者忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084703-e0w09u5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084703-e0w09u5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"蒲黄配合五灵脂，治产后腹痛，产后血晕，不省人事，亦治妇人痛经，单用炒黑，止一切血均效。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122084657-8w9w3rp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084657-8w9w3rp"}},{"ID":"20240122084657-bkwokdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084657-bkwokdm","updated":"20240129112757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第六十一味，蒲黄。这个防风诸位看一下，切片以后，长这样子。这个蒲黄呢，你们可以传阅一下，这个蒲黄我们内外都用，内科外科都在用。蒲黄本来呢我们用的是蒲黄花的花粉，花粉，你拿到那个就是花粉，来入药，那一般来说，我们有生用跟炒过的，你看主治，蒲黄呢味道是味甘，辛，有辛辣的味道，也有甘饴的味道，是活血化瘀的凉血活血除热，生用呢，消瘀通经，所以我们活血化瘀的药里面会用到蒲黄，那这个跌打损伤的，如果你炒过了，把这花粉炒黑了，可以用来止血，血崩，可以用外敷外涂也可以，内服也可以，两种都可以用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122084657-hu0rfu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084657-hu0rfu5","updated":"20240129112858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那病人呢，这个尤其象我们常常看，《大明》上面说哦，妇人妇科的排脓啊，疮疖，游风肿毒，下乳汁，比如我们知道是乳癌的时候，我们放蒲黄粉下去，比如说一钱，它是花粉，一钱就很多了嘛，内服的，外面用蒲黄粉，用炒过的，黑的，炒熟以后外敷，我们外敷的药，炒熟最好，因为怕有些不干净的东西嘛，灰尘啊什么不干净的东西，你炒熟以后就没有关系，外敷，那止血的效果非常的好。所以以前我们那个部队打战的时候，军人身上带点蒲黄粉，止血嘛，刀砍伤怎么样，撒上去，止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240122084657-gu8aqrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122084657-gu8aqrs"}}]}